(6263183, 926670, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, great composition.</td>', 'Lovely tones, great composition.', '2010-12-29 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263221, 926797, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this sharper, but I can definitely appreciate the feel and colors of this. It would be great on a wall of someone who appreciates nature, but still digs a modern abstract feel. Very nice overall.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this sharper, but I can definitely appreciate the feel and colors of this. It would be great on a wall of someone who appreciates nature, but still digs a modern abstract feel. Very nice overall.', '2010-12-29 00:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263231, 926503, 60173, '<td valign="top">The exposure control is great here. You very easily could have faded to black at the bottom, and you very easily could have faded to white at the top, but you didn''t. Both areas have just enough detail to intrigue the viewer.</td>', 'The exposure control is great here. You very easily could have faded to black at the bottom, and you very easily could have faded to white at the top, but you didn''t. Both areas have just enough detail to intrigue the viewer.', '2010-12-29 00:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263238, 926965, 60173, '<td valign="top">Awesome looking cake!<br/> <br/>Unfortunately the processing is very strange. If I were to guess it''s almost like a high ISO shot with a little bit of motion blur to boot, and you tried to cover that up somehow. Or you tried to add a texture. I''m not sure what it is you did, but I don''t see how the processing added anything.</td>', 'Awesome looking cake! Unfortunately the processing is very strange. If I were to guess it''s almost like a high ISO shot with a little bit of motion blur to boot, and you tried to cover that up somehow. Or you tried to add a texture. I''m not sure what it is you did, but I don''t see how the processing added anything.', '2010-12-29 00:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
