(6263748, 926469, 96751, '<td valign="top">Holy light bulbs, Batman!!!  That''s a lot of blink!  Spectacular lobby, but the overall lighting is a bit odd.  Especially on the people, who look very "cut-out"</td>', 'Holy light bulbs, Batman!!!  That''s a lot of blink!  Spectacular lobby, but the overall lighting is a bit odd.  Especially on the people, who look very "cut-out"', '2010-12-29 12:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263750, 927014, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''ve always loved this "layered" fruit set-up.  The water splash adds a really nice element, and creates a sense of movement.  Lighting is also terrific.  I''m wondering if you had to use toothpicks to keep it from toppling over.</td>', 'I''ve always loved this "layered" fruit set-up.  The water splash adds a really nice element, and creates a sense of movement.  Lighting is also terrific.  I''m wondering if you had to use toothpicks to keep it from toppling over.', '2010-12-29 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263751, 926665, 96751, '<td valign="top">VERY cool image.  I was going to go right by it, and something caught my eye.  I really had to look at this a bit because the doll looks like a real person, but of course SO tiny.  I couldn''t figure out what s/he was standing on, and how s/he got up there.  Nicely done.</td>', 'VERY cool image.  I was going to go right by it, and something caught my eye.  I really had to look at this a bit because the doll looks like a real person, but of course SO tiny.  I couldn''t figure out what s/he was standing on, and how s/he got up there.  Nicely done.', '2010-12-29 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263752, 926293, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mist is one of those things that to me does NOT benefit from Topaz.  I''ve consistently been proven wrong by voters, so don''t mind me.</td>', 'Mist is one of those things that to me does NOT benefit from Topaz.  I''ve consistently been proven wrong by voters, so don''t mind me.', '2010-12-29 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263753, 926965, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh YUM!  So colorful and enticing.  I think this might have been stronger on a less patterned plate, and with a sharper focus on the front piece.  Awesome bg blur though.</td>', 'Oh YUM!  So colorful and enticing.  I think this might have been stronger on a less patterned plate, and with a sharper focus on the front piece.  Awesome bg blur though.', '2010-12-29 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263755, 926987, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lines and light.  Exploring the underside of things is a lot of fun.  Great image.</td>', 'Fabulous lines and light.  Exploring the underside of things is a lot of fun.  Great image.', '2010-12-29 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263778, 926503, 96751, '<td valign="top">How lucky to be near sand dunes.  This is gorgeous.  I especially like the texture on the sand and lit edges in the foreground</td>', 'How lucky to be near sand dunes.  This is gorgeous.  I especially like the texture on the sand and lit edges in the foreground', '2010-12-29 12:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263783, 926670, 96751, '<td valign="top">The mother ship is arriving, within view.  He is ready, the triangulator is transmitting a coded beacon to guide the ship in.  He''s glad to go home.<br/> <br/>Or, whatever.  Stunning, fabulous image, which even for me is a bit of a stretch as "layers".</td>', 'The mother ship is arriving, within view.  He is ready, the triangulator is transmitting a coded beacon to guide the ship in.  He''s glad to go home. Or, whatever.  Stunning, fabulous image, which even for me is a bit of a stretch as "layers".', '2010-12-29 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
