(6264672, 926273, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the energy, and that one can almost sense the material this is made of. It also reminds me of a recent work by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a> <br/>(not voting this time)</td>', 'I like the energy, and that one can almost sense the material this is made of. It also reminds me of a recent work by  timfythetoo (not voting this time)', '2010-12-30 12:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
