(6265533, 926775, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I always like how cool the blown snow looks. One thing that seems odd about this photo is how bright blue the shadows are. Seems like these were increased way too much in post processing.</td>', 'Nice idea. I always like how cool the blown snow looks. One thing that seems odd about this photo is how bright blue the shadows are. Seems like these were increased way too much in post processing.', '2010-12-31 23:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
