(6266675, 926959, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really, really, want to like this photo.  Well, actually I do like it, but I''m not crazy about the end result.  Some steps in PP brought up the noise and grain, yet the blue sky is clean.  Guessing some HDR maybe and selective NR?  Anyway...it''s a lovely scene and does fit the challenge quite well IMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really, really, want to like this photo.  Well, actually I do like it, but I''m not crazy about the end result.  Some steps in PP brought up the noise and grain, yet the blue sky is clean.  Guessing some HDR maybe and selective NR?  Anyway...it''s a lovely scene and does fit the challenge quite well IMO.  Good luck.', '2011-01-01 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
