(6267286, 926464, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I see a Posthumous ribbon coming up here!</td>', 'Very cool. I see a Posthumous ribbon coming up here!', '2011-01-02 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267550, 926847, 108544, '<td valign="top">You made me say "WoW!", out loud! I really find this image striking to me. I really like the use of exposure.  Of course the image is fantastic too! Great capture and lucky to have such nice lighting/fog. I just love when adverse weather, makes a shot so unique.  Oh and the innocent by stander!<br/>Love it!</td>', 'You made me say "WoW!", out loud! I really find this image striking to me. I really like the use of exposure.  Of course the image is fantastic too! Great capture and lucky to have such nice lighting/fog. I just love when adverse weather, makes a shot so unique.  Oh and the innocent by stander!Love it!', '2011-01-02 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267554, 926253, 108544, '<td valign="top">This made me smile...<br/>Positives:  Love the use of bohken and depth of field. Very nice sharpness and detail in the lemon. <br/>Colours are fantastic with a nice composition. Subject and background lights, exposed very well.<br/>If I could find a fault, it may be the highlight on the glasses right edge. It has a over sharpened look to it.<br/>That''s being picky of course. It''s a fantastic image, worthy of my 9.</td>', 'This made me smile...Positives:  Love the use of bohken and depth of field. Very nice sharpness and detail in the lemon. Colours are fantastic with a nice composition. Subject and background lights, exposed very well.If I could find a fault, it may be the highlight on the glasses right edge. It has a over sharpened look to it.That''s being picky of course. It''s a fantastic image, worthy of my 9.', '2011-01-02 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
