(6269708, 926528, 12674, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic shot! Love the repeating forms, texture, and subtle color.</td>', 'Wow, fantastic shot! Love the repeating forms, texture, and subtle color.', '2011-01-03 21:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6269779, 926946, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the layers in this.</td>', 'I like the layers in this.', '2011-01-03 22:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6269780, 926405, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very serene and quiet. Nice framing!</td>', 'Very serene and quiet. Nice framing!', '2011-01-03 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270269, 926847, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Beautiful scene with excellent contrast.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Beautiful scene with excellent contrast.', '2011-01-04 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270304, 926658, 125605, '<td valign="top">Cool concept! Glad those feral geese let you get close enough for this shot. Go MIT!</td>', 'Cool concept! Glad those feral geese let you get close enough for this shot. Go MIT!', '2011-01-04 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270310, 926864, 125605, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this is the clouds in the background - great shot!</td>', 'My favorite part of this is the clouds in the background - great shot!', '2011-01-04 13:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270327, 926969, 125605, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept - is this a foggy mirror or is something else going on?</td>', 'Interesting concept - is this a foggy mirror or is something else going on?', '2011-01-04 14:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270329, 927036, 125605, '<td valign="top">Cool concept - I like the triangles made by all the shadows between the rocks. I''m not sure about this, but maybe underexposing the rocks might have brought out a little bit more of the texture. Also, maybe waiting for more indirect/horizontal sunlight might have created a lot of cool mini-shadows on the rock face.</td>', 'Cool concept - I like the triangles made by all the shadows between the rocks. I''m not sure about this, but maybe underexposing the rocks might have brought out a little bit more of the texture. Also, maybe waiting for more indirect/horizontal sunlight might have created a lot of cool mini-shadows on the rock face.', '2011-01-04 14:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270333, 926469, 125605, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Given the nature of the location, this might be unfeasible, but waiting for an hour where there are no people around might have added a bit to the shot.</td>', 'Cool shot! Given the nature of the location, this might be unfeasible, but waiting for an hour where there are no people around might have added a bit to the shot.', '2011-01-04 14:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270338, 926426, 125605, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I like this a lot. My first gut feeling was that cropping out the actual bridge at the top and leaving only the worn/stained concrete would''ve made the shot more mysterious while still keeping it obvious as to what your subject is (since you can still see the bridge through the opening of the first oval). Very cool!</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I like this a lot. My first gut feeling was that cropping out the actual bridge at the top and leaving only the worn/stained concrete would''ve made the shot more mysterious while still keeping it obvious as to what your subject is (since you can still see the bridge through the opening of the first oval). Very cool!', '2011-01-04 14:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270343, 926269, 125605, '<td valign="top">Some creative lighting to bring out the cool textures on the gargoyle might have been nice, but otherwise cool shot!</td>', 'Some creative lighting to bring out the cool textures on the gargoyle might have been nice, but otherwise cool shot!', '2011-01-04 14:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270348, 926501, 125605, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! I especially love the interplay between the red/blue of the books in the pews, the panels of the vaulted ceilings, and the flags. Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful colors! I especially love the interplay between the red/blue of the books in the pews, the panels of the vaulted ceilings, and the flags. Nice.', '2011-01-04 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270349, 926947, 125605, '<td valign="top">Your subject bears a strange resemblance to Zach Galifianakis in The Hangover, and thus pleases me enormously.</td>', 'Your subject bears a strange resemblance to Zach Galifianakis in The Hangover, and thus pleases me enormously.', '2011-01-04 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270353, 927031, 125605, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Very curious to hear the technique behind this one.</td>', 'This is beautiful! Very curious to hear the technique behind this one.', '2011-01-04 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270359, 926503, 125605, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful...very nice work balancing exposure of the shadow in the first dune and the sky - that looks like it was really challenging, but you did a great job.</td>', 'This is beautiful...very nice work balancing exposure of the shadow in the first dune and the sky - that looks like it was really challenging, but you did a great job.', '2011-01-04 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270363, 926985, 125605, '<td valign="top">Great b/w contrast going on throughout the whole portrait.</td>', 'Great b/w contrast going on throughout the whole portrait.', '2011-01-04 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270366, 926721, 125605, '<td valign="top">Nice job freezing the action on this one.</td>', 'Nice job freezing the action on this one.', '2011-01-04 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270367, 926803, 125605, '<td valign="top">You just made me so hungry that I walked out of class to buy a cookie, which is as close to this beautiful dessert as I can get right now. Beautiful colors!</td>', 'You just made me so hungry that I walked out of class to buy a cookie, which is as close to this beautiful dessert as I can get right now. Beautiful colors!', '2011-01-04 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270370, 926827, 125605, '<td valign="top">Did you desat the sky on this one? I love the contrast between the rocks and the overcast.</td>', 'Did you desat the sky on this one? I love the contrast between the rocks and the overcast.', '2011-01-04 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270374, 926335, 125605, '<td valign="top">I like the clay tinge on the sand here. Also, the one random person in the far right adds so much to this shot - I''m glad he was there.</td>', 'I like the clay tinge on the sand here. Also, the one random person in the far right adds so much to this shot - I''m glad he was there.', '2011-01-04 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270376, 926957, 125605, '<td valign="top">The scary dark clouds are really cool in this one and really bring out the snow. Nice shot.</td>', 'The scary dark clouds are really cool in this one and really bring out the snow. Nice shot.', '2011-01-04 14:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270377, 926629, 125605, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know what I''m looking at in this shot, but it''s incredibly visually pleasing. Wonderful use of DOF!</td>', 'I don''t even know what I''m looking at in this shot, but it''s incredibly visually pleasing. Wonderful use of DOF!', '2011-01-04 14:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270382, 926405, 125605, '<td valign="top">I like the colors! Maybe could have used a bit more sharpness on the leaves.</td>', 'I like the colors! Maybe could have used a bit more sharpness on the leaves.', '2011-01-04 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270385, 926793, 125605, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know chickens had camouflage! Cool!</td>', 'I didn''t know chickens had camouflage! Cool!', '2011-01-04 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270388, 926670, 125605, '<td valign="top">Favorited this one - beautiful shot! What''s the structure in background? At first I thought it was a tripod...good stuff.</td>', 'Favorited this one - beautiful shot! What''s the structure in background? At first I thought it was a tripod...good stuff.', '2011-01-04 14:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270392, 926849, 125605, '<td valign="top">This is so cool...I wish the shutter speed had been a bit higher to get rid of the distracting blur on the tail and claws. Great moment though!</td>', 'This is so cool...I wish the shutter speed had been a bit higher to get rid of the distracting blur on the tail and claws. Great moment though!', '2011-01-04 14:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270394, 926361, 125605, '<td valign="top">Can never go wrong with yellow/blue contrast shots...nice job!</td>', 'Can never go wrong with yellow/blue contrast shots...nice job!', '2011-01-04 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270397, 926545, 125605, '<td valign="top">Haha how long did it take to make that? I would''ve liked to see the textures on the bands a bit sharper though.</td>', 'Haha how long did it take to make that? I would''ve liked to see the textures on the bands a bit sharper though.', '2011-01-04 14:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270399, 926946, 125605, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this is snow/overcast sky or if you desaturated the whole shot - either way, cool pic!</td>', 'Can''t tell if this is snow/overcast sky or if you desaturated the whole shot - either way, cool pic!', '2011-01-04 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270400, 926253, 125605, '<td valign="top">I love oranges - nice textures bringing out each little cell of the fruit. Whats the background?</td>', 'I love oranges - nice textures bringing out each little cell of the fruit. Whats the background?', '2011-01-04 14:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270492, 926503, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is awesome.  The textures are great.  I also like the play of light and shadows. A top ten for sure.</td>', 'Wow, this is awesome.  The textures are great.  I also like the play of light and shadows. A top ten for sure.', '2011-01-04 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270571, 926591, 12250, '<td valign="top">Great location and subject but the highlights are a bit distracting to warrant a higher score.  B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'Great location and subject but the highlights are a bit distracting to warrant a higher score.  B&W works well.', '2011-01-04 16:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270572, 926934, 12250, '<td valign="top">Interesting - Good color, like the different shapes, like the dof.  Not sure exactly what it is that I''m looking at but overall solid photo.</td>', 'Interesting - Good color, like the different shapes, like the dof.  Not sure exactly what it is that I''m looking at but overall solid photo.', '2011-01-04 16:22:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6270578, 926795, 12250, '<td valign="top">Distracting yet effective.  I also like the complimentary colors.</td>', 'Distracting yet effective.  I also like the complimentary colors.', '2011-01-04 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270584, 926959, 12250, '<td valign="top">A bit over-processed for my taste but good photo.  I like the fog below with the trees peaking through as well as the high level dramatic clouds.</td>', 'A bit over-processed for my taste but good photo.  I like the fog below with the trees peaking through as well as the high level dramatic clouds.', '2011-01-04 16:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270591, 926629, 12250, '<td valign="top">Very simple and a good entry for the particular challenge. DOF pleases the eye along with the horizontal lines on the subject.</td>', 'Very simple and a good entry for the particular challenge. DOF pleases the eye along with the horizontal lines on the subject.', '2011-01-04 16:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270604, 926803, 12250, '<td valign="top">Lighting a bit harsh for a higher score.  Does look tasty!</td>', 'Lighting a bit harsh for a higher score.  Does look tasty!', '2011-01-04 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270607, 926268, 12250, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF, detail, and colors.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very nice DOF, detail, and colors.  One of my favorites so far.', '2011-01-04 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270613, 926293, 12250, '<td valign="top">Something about the blue tones of mountains and clouds that make this feel calming.  Solid entry.</td>', 'Something about the blue tones of mountains and clouds that make this feel calming.  Solid entry.', '2011-01-04 16:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270624, 926946, 12250, '<td valign="top">Nice layered landscape.  My focus is drawn towards the top of the hill.  A bit more or less happening in the layers would raise the score even higher.</td>', 'Nice layered landscape.  My focus is drawn towards the top of the hill.  A bit more or less happening in the layers would raise the score even higher.', '2011-01-04 16:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270628, 926972, 12250, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the processing and lack of detail hurts the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'Great idea but the processing and lack of detail hurts the photo in my opinion.', '2011-01-04 16:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270632, 926725, 12250, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The red and green really makes this for me as well as the softness of the rows of tea.  One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  The red and green really makes this for me as well as the softness of the rows of tea.  One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2011-01-04 16:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270637, 926937, 12250, '<td valign="top">Another one of those simple yet effective images.  Very nice feel and I like the blue color tone.  One of my top pics in this challenge.</td>', 'Another one of those simple yet effective images.  Very nice feel and I like the blue color tone.  One of my top pics in this challenge.', '2011-01-04 16:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270648, 926812, 12250, '<td valign="top">What in the world?  It almost looks like a Christmas piece for a arctic train set.  I think I see an iced Santa with a hat on in the center and a walrus at the top.  Cool pic.</td>', 'What in the world?  It almost looks like a Christmas piece for a arctic train set.  I think I see an iced Santa with a hat on in the center and a walrus at the top.  Cool pic.', '2011-01-04 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270651, 926826, 12250, '<td valign="top">Very elegant.  Feels like Valentine''s Day!</td>', 'Very elegant.  Feels like Valentine''s Day!', '2011-01-04 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270655, 926928, 12250, '<td valign="top">The silhouette adds to the pic greatly.</td>', 'The silhouette adds to the pic greatly.', '2011-01-04 16:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270660, 926286, 12250, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Great tones and shallow DOF works for this image. <br/> <br/>What does femy wi mean?</td>', 'I like it.  Great tones and shallow DOF works for this image.  What does femy wi mean?', '2011-01-04 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270667, 926503, 12250, '<td valign="top">Top pic in the challenge!  Great lines and tones.  Well done.</td>', 'Top pic in the challenge!  Great lines and tones.  Well done.', '2011-01-04 17:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270675, 926739, 12250, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and B&amp;W looks good.  I''d like to see the color version.  Could have been a tough decision between B&amp;W/color.</td>', 'Nice exposure and B&W looks good.  I''d like to see the color version.  Could have been a tough decision between B&W/color.', '2011-01-04 17:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270683, 926464, 61961, '<td valign="top">I don''t always leap to praise abstracts, but this is one of my two challenge favorites.  Lovely.</td>', 'I don''t always leap to praise abstracts, but this is one of my two challenge favorites.  Lovely.', '2011-01-04 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270727, 926739, 66709, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2011-01-04 17:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270807, 926812, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I wanted to give it a ten but the crop is a bit off for me so its a 9.</td>', 'This is a great photo. I wanted to give it a ten but the crop is a bit off for me so its a 9.', '2011-01-04 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270811, 926528, 121949, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to give this a higher score. It is a great photo and a great example of layers but your horizon is off. Still a 7 from me.</td>', 'I really wanted to give this a higher score. It is a great photo and a great example of layers but your horizon is off. Still a 7 from me.', '2011-01-04 18:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
