(6271794, 926847, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure why this didn''t do better.  Your entry is unique, catches the viewers attention, and invites a closer study.  For me, these are the elements that make an interesting image.  Yours also tells a story.  I look forward to seeing more of your work.</td>', 'I''m really not sure why this didn''t do better.  Your entry is unique, catches the viewers attention, and invites a closer study.  For me, these are the elements that make an interesting image.  Yours also tells a story.  I look forward to seeing more of your work.', '2011-01-05 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
