(6272227, 926739, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red Alicia! Great tones in this B&amp;W...and maybe it''s just me but I see an additional ''layer''/pattern. The grain on the wood of the pier reminds/takes on the aspects of the waves/ripples of the sea.</td>', 'Congrats on the Red Alicia! Great tones in this B&W...and maybe it''s just me but I see an additional ''layer''/pattern. The grain on the wood of the pier reminds/takes on the aspects of the waves/ripples of the sea.', '2011-01-05 13:02:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6272237, 926812, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing! It almost doesn''t look like a real lighthouse - it almost takes on the aspect of a chilly layered cake with killer ICI(ng)CLES :-) The ice and icicles are just amazing to see coated on this lighthouse - glad you were able to capture some seagulls in the shot for it greatly complements this winter seascape shot. Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing! It almost doesn''t look like a real lighthouse - it almost takes on the aspect of a chilly layered cake with killer ICI(ng)CLES :-) The ice and icicles are just amazing to see coated on this lighthouse - glad you were able to capture some seagulls in the shot for it greatly complements this winter seascape shot. Congrats on the blue!', '2011-01-05 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
